  "caption": "87% of Sri Lankan adults don't exercise. And seeni and pressure are common in our families.\n\nThe good news is you don't need a gym. Ten minutes of push-ups, 3 days a week, is a good start. Begin on a wall if you need to.\n\nTag someone who keeps saying \"from Monday\".\n\nSources: WHO STEPS Sri Lanka 2021; Momma et al., BJSM 2022; Alkhayl et al., Sci Rep 2022. These show links, not guarantees. If you have a heart condition or high blood pressure, talk to your doctor first.\n\n#SriLanka #calisthenics #pushups #srilankafitness #bodyweightworkout"
